      (the last thing the engine said) until unfolded to ten; the same stream as Engine's log, not a second one -->
 <aside class="log-dock is-folded" id="logDock" aria-label="Server log">
+  <div class="log-dock-grip" id="logDockGrip" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical" aria-label="The log's width" data-tip="Drag to widen the log, up to 1200 px; a double click gives its own width back"></div>
   <div class="log-dock-head">
     <!-- HERESY 1301 (Viktor 10.10.2026: «SVG иконка в левой позиции со стрелкой вправо, в правой - влево»): the dock to the other side,
          kept for the room; on the dock's inner edge (app.css orders it last when the dock is on the left) -->
